[00:07.68]1. Come with rejoicing, and learn about Jehovah.
[00:15.36]“Come drink life’s water,” the spirit has said.
[00:20.49]Healthful instruction, God has provided.
[00:25.63]All those who hunger for truth will be fed.
[00:41.95]2. Never forsaking our gathering together,
[00:48.83]We must be taught; we must learn what is right.
[00:56.44]Here with God’s spirit, here with our brothers,
[01:03.34]Here we are strengthened to walk in the light.
[01:30.81]3. Lips that sing praise, how encouraging to hear them!
[01:37.53]Tongues of the taught ones, how sweet is their sound!
[01:46.12]Oh, may we always meet with God’s people!
[01:51.76]Oh, may we always among them be found!